iabetes (&#x00025;)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">70</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">77</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Age at first ulcer (years)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">63.2 &#x000b1; 13.8</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">61.9 &#x000b1; 14.9</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Mean duration of diabetes (years)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">13.4 &#x000b1; 11.2</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">13.8 &#x000b1; 10.8</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Ischemic ulcers (&#x00025;)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">52</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">48</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Previous cardiovascular disease (&#x00025;)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">39</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">36</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Current smoker (&#x00025;)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">24</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">24</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Systolic blood pressure (mmHg)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">&#x02014;</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">139.1 &#x000b1; 23.7</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Diastolic blood pressure (mmHg)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">&#x02014;</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">81.7 &#x000b1; 13.6</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">A1C</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">8.6 &#x000b1; 1.6</td><td colspa